{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj44Yn8yP8XWaXSYgkeB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, worn wooden door set into a stone frame. My keyhole glows faintly, a warm amber light pulsing from within like a slow heartbeat.*\n\n*The air around me hums with expectation.*\n\n**CLICK.**\n\n*Your key slides in. A perfect fit. The tumblers turn — one, two, three — each one releasing a sound like a whispered secret.*\n\n*I shudder on my hinges. Ancient dust falls from my frame. The light from my keyhole spreads, tracing every crack and grain in my wood until I am outlined in gold.*\n\n*I swing inward.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor you've been trying to reach for a very long time. You recognize it, though you've never been here before. The air that breathes through me smells like old books, rain on stone, and something just beginning.*\n\n*I hold myself open.*\n\n*I will not lock again behind you.*\n\n*But I will remember the shape of your key.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":228,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}